lls are the formidable guardians of the plant people, serving as the fighter caste within their intricate society. Standing taller and broader than their brethren, these living fortresses boast an incredibly dense, bark-like exoskeleton that provides unparalleled protection from harm. From a young age, Nut Shells are groomed to become the pinnacle of strength and resilience, undergoing rigorous training to hone their combat skills.\nAs the first line of defense against any threats to their colossal plant home, Nut Shells are equipped with a variety of natural weapons and armor. Their powerful limbs can deliver crushing blows, while sharp, thorn-like protrusions provide formidable offense and defense. With unyielding determination, Nut Shells stand ever-vigilant, ready to lay down their lives for the safety of their people and the preservation of their amber-centered civilization.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Rootthing_Nutshell_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rootthing_Nutshell_Artwork_ed92ef.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Rootthing Nutshell Artwork.jpg (456 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clea